// The doctor's hello script.
// A slightly deeper branch to show a second layer of choices.

The doctor peers over his glasses at you.
"Ah. A visitor. I wasn't expecting anyone today."

* [Hello, doctor. Can I help with anything?]
    "Help?" He chuckles. "That's a rare offer around here."
    Do you know your way around a laboratory?
    * * [Yes, I've worked in one before.]
        "Excellent. Stop by tomorrow — I could use the extra hands."
        -> END
    * * [Not at all, but I can learn.]
        "Curiosity is half the battle. Come back when you have a free afternoon."
        -> END

* [Just passing through.]
    "Ah, a wanderer. Mind your step near the tall grass — things bite out there."
    -> END
